    "Actual results for the fiscal year ended June 30, 2024, as the city reported them to the Census Bureau's Annual Survey of State and Local Government Finances. Not a budget.",
    "Public schools are run by separate school districts with their own taxes, so they are not included. Residents also pay Clinton County and, in the counties that have them, the township they live in.",
